@startuml
title One Authoritative Grammar, Two Parser Delivery Paths
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #334155
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F5F9
skinparam NoteBorderColor #94A3B8

component "Greg's **Module / Theory**\nauthoring surface" as surface #FDE68A
component "ordinary Rholang value\n**language/2**" as value #E0E7FF
component "**GrammarCore v1**\nstable IDs · no Rust source" as core #DBEAFE
component "fail-closed validation\nlimits · capabilities · identity" as gate #A7F3D0
component "verified **ParserImage v1**\nlexer tables · WPDA tables · reductions" as image #DCFCE7
component "table-oriented micro-op VM\nGSS / SPPF WPDA walker" as vm #BFDBFE
component "existing **language!**\ntyped-Rust parser generator" as typed #FEF3C7
component "Versioned Registry\nspec required · image optional" as registry #DDD6FE
component "future File I/O capability\nFile I/O FIPS — not implemented here" as fileio #F1F5F9

surface -[#7C3AED,dashed]-> value : A4 desugaring parity
value -[#334155]-> core : A1 sole lowering
typed -[#334155]-> core : A1 conformance projection
core -[#334155]-> gate : A1 validate before compile
gate -[#334155]-> image : A1 compile + verify
image -[#334155]-> vm : A1 execute
registry -[#334155]-> value : A1 authoritative spec
registry -[#334155]-> image : A1 optional cache
fileio .[#334155].> registry : A6 future resolver capability
typed -[#DC2626,dashed]-> vm : A5 ✗ existing typed parsers do not detour through VM

note bottom of registry
  An image is accepted only when its grammar fingerprint,
  image ABI, compiler ABI, Unicode version, and limits agree.
  Any mismatch discards the image and recompiles from the value.
end note

legend right
  |= Colour |= Concept (pinned palette, diagrams/PALETTE.md) |
  |<#FDE68A> | **P1** Human-facing Module / Theory surface |
  |<#FEF3C7> | **P2** Existing Rust-embedded path |
  |<#E0E7FF> | **P3** Canonical specification value |
  |<#DBEAFE> | **P4** Shared specification datatype / IR seam |
  |<#DCFCE7> | **P5** Fully declarative parser image |
  |<#BFDBFE> | **P8** Runtime substrate |
  |<#A7F3D0> | **P9** Fail-closed gate |
  |<#DDD6FE> | **P11** Registry-resolved capability or theory |
  |<#F1F5F9> | **P14** Scoped future-integration note |
  |<#334155> | **A1** Ordinary dataflow |
  |<#7C3AED> | **A4** Equality / parity obligation (dashed) |
  |<#DC2626> | **A5** Path that does not exist (dashed, leading ✗) |
  |<#334155> | **A6** Soft future relation (dotted) |
endlegend
@enduml
